WEBVTT

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.720
It's cold.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.510
It is.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.910
Ramen.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.890
It is.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:39.060
Ramen

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.320
<i>Ramen.</i>

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.730
<i>A noodle soup dish passed on 
from China during the Meiji era</i>

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.430
<i>and adapted to Japanese tastes.</i>

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.610
<i>It has been arranged in 
various ways since the war.</i>

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.610
<i>Japanese culinary culture demands 
chewiness from its noodles.</i>

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:39.440
<i>With its firm texture and brine soup,</i>

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.810
<i>it gripped the soul of the Japanese 
people, and has never let go.</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.390
<i>It is a favorite to this day.</i>

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.090
I'm getting hungry.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.060
Yeah.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.900
Should we have some?

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
Ramen
700 yen

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.900
No, I'm not in the mood today.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.670
<i>700 yen for a meal?!</i>

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.280
<i>I don't have that kind of money!</i>

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.910
Let's go home, Rokumon.

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.310
Rokumon, where'd you go?

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:52.730
Spirited Ramen

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:52.330
<i>A ramen restaurant opened shop by school.</i>

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:57.240
I heard it's 100 yen a bowl 
during their opening sale.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.830
Wow, that's a good deal.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.150
Want to check it out after school?

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.840
That shop's been vacant 
for a while, hasn't it?

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.910
Yeah, I heard rumors about 
creepy things happening there.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.660
Creepy things?

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.670
Someone saw something when 
they passed by at night.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:16.390
There was a Hitodama flying around 
busily in the empty kitchen.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:19.860
A Hitodama?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.910
Maybe it was just a rumor.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.280
It's a request letter.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.680
It's not from someone at school?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.810
From a ramen shop in the neighborhood.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:35.890
"The head chef's been possessed ever 
since we opened. He's in agony.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.800
Please help.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.700
I've including free ramen 
coupons as payment."

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.700
Ramen Kaedama
Free Ramen

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.160
We get free ramen?!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.580
We shall have to go!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.590
Here.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:02.880
Rokudou-kun.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.790
Are you here for ramen, too?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.970
You have money? Buy me some.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.810
We've been waiting for you, Rinne-sama.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.440
<i>Um, isn't this person...</i>

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.550
Damashigami!

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.860
Prepare yourself!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:21.990
<i>Coin throw.</i>

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:26.370
<i>Ageha.</i>

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.850
Are they opening yet?

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.200
I can't wait.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.230
I want to eat now.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:34.490
<i>Shinigami Ageha can't be 
seen by ordinary people.</i>

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.000
Don't bother hiding it.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.500
I have information that the 
Damashigami bought this shop.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:45.510
Little girl, did you think a 
coin toss would work on me?

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.970
Actually...

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.010
She hit her, dead on.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.810
Onee-chan!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.900
You caught me, Ageha.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:07.160
Boss                      Secretary

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.480
<i>While hunting for Damashigami,</i>

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.290
<i>Ageha's sister fell in love with 
their leader, Rinne's father.</i>

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:07.160
<i>Currently, she works as the boss' 
secretary at Damashigami Company.</i>

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.370
Help me, please, Rinne-sama.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.200
The boss is in trouble.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.730
Does that mean...

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.710
The head chef that's been 
possessed by an evil spirit...

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.090
Is Dad?

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:29.020
He's so fast you can't even see his hands.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.720
The head chef's so hot.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.030
Here you are.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.910
What?!

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:42.230
Dad's working like a normal person?!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.400
No freaking way.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:47.280
Did he reintegrate into society?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.070
This restaurant doesn't have menus.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.870
Sakura-sama, look.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:56.790
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:56.790
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:56.790
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.380
Nothing but ramen?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.790
They don't have gyoza or rice or anything.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.170
It's a miracle that he's even working.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.000
I guess we can't expect much.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.630
No, that's not it.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.430
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.430
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.430
Ramen -- 100 yen

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:06.750
Jumonji.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:12.430
A lot of recent ramen shops 
serve nothing but ramen.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.430
Ramen
 100 yen

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:18.080
But they don't even have pork or menma ramen,
 which is just more of the same ingredients.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.700
Not even an extra large.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.800
Nor do they have oiliness or 
noodle cookedness options.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:23.690
Menu choices
 Noodles: Soft, Medium, Firm
 Soup: Light, Medium, Rich
 Oil: Less, Medium, More
 Vegetables: Less, Medium, More
 Garlic: None, Medium, More

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.690
Or richness or garlic content.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.320
They don't even have pepper here.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.660
You're right.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:33.620
Which means this store is focusing 
solely on one ramen dish.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.370
So...

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.910
Bingo!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:41.170
This place is <i>really </i>
confident of their ramen.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.550
Very well.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:51.930
Through my travels as an exorcist,
 I've consumed ramen from all across the country.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:52.070
Okinawa soba   Kumamoto ramen   Hakata ramen   Tokushima ramen   Wakayama ramen   Onomichi ramen   Tokyo ramen   Kitakata ramen   Sapporo ramen   Ashikawa ramen

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.920
I accept your challenge!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.890
Ramen, please.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.520
Sure thing.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:10.450
He chops the green onions only after 
the order, so as to keep it fresh.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.560
And <i>then</i> he chops the pork.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.380
Excellent attention to detail.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:21.220
However, that won't be enough to sway me.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.180
That technique...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.090
It's the legendary Polygonal 
Corner Straining.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:38.350
To think there was anyone 
that could pull it off!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.760
Here you are.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.820
He's...

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.280
He's good.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.110
You haven't even tried it. You can tell?

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:53.740
The bowl itself conveys the chef's soul.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:57.120
This deep yet slim bowl.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:02.290
This perfect balance between the 
amount of noodles and of the soup.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:06.500
This well-calculated shape, preserving 
the volume of its silhouette.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.580
There's something about him, 
to have chosen this bowl.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.460
I like it.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.140
Let us test your skill.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.640
Time to eat.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.880
What...

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:23.890
What's the problem?

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.810
Until recently,

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:30.870
the noodles were the main part of the meal, 
and the soup was nothing but a sauce.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:36.690
But modern ramen, having undergone much 
evolution in the recent ramen boom,

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:39.060
puts the spotlight on the 
soup, made painstakingly from

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.270
carefully-selected ingredients.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:49.670
Ramen dishes where the noodles are the 
filling for the soup are all the rage.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.180
But this ramen...

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:58.130
Neither the noodles nor the 
soup take center stage!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:06.290
They each bring out the 
other in a perfect balance,

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:10.260
constructed from the golden 
ratio for impeccable flavor.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:16.760
The pork soy sauce soup packs 
a punch, while the firm, crisp,

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:22.050
thick noodles fit in a mouthful for every 
slurp, yet they're of a satisfying length.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:30.470
The green onions, the pork, the menma 
all accentuate the noodles in each bite.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.960
They bring out the taste of the 
soup without being overbearing.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:33.960
Gulp.

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.840
It's peppered to just the right degree,

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.850
and the soup is finished just in 
time for you to finish the noodles.

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:53.610
Combined with the noodles, 
not too stiff and not too soggy,

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.940
it's nothing short of godly!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.340
He relies on nothing but his 
sensibilities and skill,

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:04.750
without depending on pretentious, 
high-quality ingredients.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.690
Impressive.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.460
I'll be back, pops.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.160
What the hell was that?

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.010
I don't remember him loving ramen so much.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:21.600
But it really does look 
like he's working hard.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.720
What part of this is 
"possessed by evil spirits"?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:28.280
Boss, Rinne-sama's here to see you.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:28.940
Really?

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.880
You've decided to work, Dad?

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.570
Rinne, I've been waiting for you.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.570
Have you really reformed?

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:44.570
Rinne, Dad, your dad...

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:49.580
Daddy doesn't want to work!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.330
Oh.

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:55.210
But my body keeps making ramen!

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:56.920
What's going on?

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.590
It was on the day of the opening.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.970
The ramen shop is just a front.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:10.080
Those foolish students are going 
to come for the 100 yen ramen,

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.100
and we're going to take them 
straight to the afterlife.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:14.360
Without serving a bowl of ramen.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:19.400
And it happens that no one buys 
this building for some reason.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.400
We got it for nearly nothing.

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:26.870
And, like, we paid them 
with a check that'll bounce.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.140
You're unbelievable.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:33.000
Ow.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.000
Your sister's totally an evil henchman now.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.820
You seriously suck.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.840
And just then!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.720
Listen to me!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:47.370
A light... a mist appeared, and...

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.300
We're in business!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.060
Boss!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.680
And now he's possessed.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:12:00.070
<i>So it's probably a spirit that's 
been bound to this shop.</i>

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:03.340
Apparently the head chef 
is Rokudou-kun's dad.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.530
They look alike.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.560
That was good.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:07.740
Thank you.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.700
I left the 100 yen there.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.290
Let's come back tomorrow.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.820
Everyone's happy.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.370
It must be really good ramen.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.800
He might as well stay possessed for life.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.060
Oh, no!

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.760
He's crying blood and passing 
out at the same time!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:31.020
Just for working like a 
normal person? Really?

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:52.040
Seriously though, Dad's 
technically a Shinigami.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.460
I can't believe he can't 
exorcise a single spirit.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.920
Boss has been slacking off for years.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.780
Fortunately, Dad's passed out.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.650
Let's talk to the spirit.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:02.920
With the Separation Incense.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:09.430
Separation Incense

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:09.430
<i>Separation Incense is a Shinigami tool that 
brings out an attached spirit with smoke.</i>

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:20.320
My.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:25.320
He's an honest-looking young 
man with sparkling eyes.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.350
Please tell us.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.950
What is keeping you here?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.030
I love ramen.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:33.330
My dream was to open up a ramen shop.

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:37.530
I studied at all kinds of shops, 
and worked without sleep or rest.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:39.840
Finally, I opened up this shop.

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:45.220
Raaamen

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:45.220
Right on the day before we were to open, 
all the built-up stress finally got to me.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.050
I collapsed in the kitchen, and that was it.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.450
Without serving a single bowl of ramen?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.850
That must have been disappointing.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:57.070
Let me ask, just to be sure...

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:59.520
What would you need in 
order to rest in peace?

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:05.740
Well of course, I want to use a living body 
like I did today to make delicious ramen.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.890
I want to see my customers happy.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.530
Now if I can do that for 
about a hundred years...

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.870
A hundred years?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:13.880
Sure.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.710
Dad.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.250
Go ahead and use my body.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.830
You'd really let me?

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.040
Yeah, I'm sure.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.130
Thank you!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.090
I won't ever forget this!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.200
Work to your heart's content.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.220
I'll do everything I can to help.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.930
It can't be, Boss, are you hooked on working?

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.190
No way.

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:39.310
This guy, of all people? That's impossible.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.920
But if this parasite dad 
becomes a proper person,

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.860
Onee-chan might go back to being 
the badass she used to be.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.170
Go ahead and clear up all your regrets.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.620
For as many hundreds of years as you want.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.240
Rinne-Dad, are you scheming something?

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:59.500
I should have finished him 
off while he was passed out.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.910
Done! Done!

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.400
Let's go have ramen.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.790
I heard the head chef is Rokudou-kun's dad.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.470
I want to see him.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:19.850
There's a line.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:29.360
Yakitori

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:23.140
Rinne-sama, are you just 
going to let this go on?

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.400
I don't care what happens to my dad.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.360
But I want to help that 
hard-working ramen chef pass on.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.570
Thanks for coming.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.450
That was delicious.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.210
They looked like they had 
their souls sucked out.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.760
Welcome.

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:47.980
There's already something else working, 
after saying he'd lend his body.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.340
It's a Yorishiro Doll.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.590
The owner's so hot.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:55.600
<i>But to a normal person, he looks human.</i>

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:58.850
Oh my, Rinne-sama, Sakura-sama, come in.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.230
Eat up.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.610
Ageha.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.110
Don't eat that!

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:09.990
I won't.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.860
Yummy.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:13.860
They're eating it.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.360
Thank you.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.730
Rinne-sama, their souls.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.300
Nom this nom!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.280
The chewiness, the texture!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.980
I've never had anything this delicious.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.500
Thank you.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:48.010
Why's that guy eating it?

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:50.290
He's an exorcist and he didn't notice?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:52.770
He must really like ramen.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.710
That way.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.170
Hey.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.790
What's with this relaxation room?

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.920
Weren't you going to lend 
your body to the ramen chef?

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.430
Oh, about that...

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.430
This body can work without sleep or rest.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.990
Without sleep or rest?!

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:21.870
Here.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.510
You can use these, too.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:26.270
Special Kaedama noodles.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.020
Kaedama noodles?

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.330
Yup.

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:32.600
They were developed by 
Damashigami Company Foods.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:36.780
They're special noodles that push 
the souls out of whoever eats them.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:38.780
Then...

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.970
Yup.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.540
The more he works...

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:45.370
See, look at all these spirits.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.870
That was a heavy one.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.120
You wretch.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.130
If we don't do something, that ramen chef...

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:56.010
I want to make delicious ramen 
and see my customers happy.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.760
<i>He's going to end up being 
manipulated into working for evil.</i>

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.230
Here you are.

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:07.260
I feel bad for him, but he'll 
have to leave the Yorishiro Doll.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:08.310
With the Separation Incense.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.400
Kapow!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.300
He doesn't seem to like people
getting in the way of his work.

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.580
Hey, you!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:19.640
Can't you tell you're being fooled?

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.160
Does this even look right?

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.410
The customers are happy, though.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:26.790
You don't care?

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.490
Nice try, Rinne.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:33.000
You don't understand the 
true nature of this spirit.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:33.960
What?

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:38.970
Keep this in mind: spirits aren't sensible.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.420
He doesn't care about anything, so 
long as his customers are happy:

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.080
so long as he can work.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.100
In fact, let him have that, 
and he'll do <i>anything</i>.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:51.860
And you think someone like 
you could help him rest?

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:57.030
Yeah, right. Weren't you the one that 
came begging him to exorcise him, Rinne-Dad?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.490
Rinne, say something!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:04.030
I'm defeated, for now!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.110
I'll get you!

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.250
Ramen Kaedama here.

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:15.200
<i>I'd like a delivery, please.</i>

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.500
<i>500 bowls of ramen.</i>

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.630
Delivered to Damashigami Company.

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.890
You're harassing them? Just because you lost?

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.270
I'm making 500 bowls of ramen!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.610
W-Wow.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.480
Deliveries are all about speed, though.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.750
Can he do it?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.360
You're back.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.990
I'll work hard!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.870
Are you sure this is going to make him rest?

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.410
Long, long ago, a warlord on 
the brink of execution...

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.500
What are you even talking about?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.510
I'll curse your entire family 
until your last generation!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.600
Hilarious.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:01.510
Then take a bite of that rock 
to show your determination.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:07.150
And the decapitated warlord's 
head really bit on the rock.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:12.380
It terrified the people, but the 
enemy warlord was never cursed.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.270
Why?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:20.940
Rock! Rock! Rock!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:17.560
Because the warlord was so focused on 
biting on the rock in front of him,

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.260
he forgot to curse the other warlord.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.440
In other words...

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.570
You're swapping out his goals?

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:29.880
True, making 500 bowls of ramen 
would be pretty satisfying.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.460
He might be able to rest.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.650
It broke!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.380
It was overworked.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.140
Boss, are you going home?

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.610
Yeah, we got a huge haul.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.600
Let's take the spirits to the afterlife.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.400
500!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.270
Boss!

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:58.540
Yes!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:01.020
It's totally swapped out its goal.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:09.530
Shake, shake, shake!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:08.840
<i>And so Rokudou-kun's dad was worked making 
ramen until he was like an old rag.</i>

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.630
500 bowls!

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.100
Don't give up, Boss.

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:14.660
Just a hundred more bowls.

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:17.590
Satisfaction!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:21.800
<i>Thanks to that, the ramen 
chef passed on safely.</i>

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:34.310
The Damashigami enjoyed the ramen very much.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:34.310
 Boss's Ramen Party

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.310
<i>The spirits stolen with the Kaedama noodles</i>

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:40.210
<i>were given back to their respective bodies.</i>

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.070
What was I doing all this time?

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.540
You had your soul sucked out by fake ramen.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.890
To deceive the enemy, first deceive your own.

00:21:56.890 --> 00:22:00.080
It was a bait strategy to expose his scheme.

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.840
You weren't bait, you were prey.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:07.080
Have you heard?

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:09.680
The ramen shop closed.

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:12.100
But it was so good.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.600
Out of Business

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:17.330
Let's leave thank-you cards.

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.080
Yeah.

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.190
Out of Business

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.730
Delicious!
I want more
I wanted a hundred more
 I'll never forget
Thank you! I hope you'll
be back someday
 Loved it, man

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.730
Me gusta
 I loved the soup!
 I love you, head chef!
 Ramen Kaedama is the best
 Thank you for the
delicious ramen!

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:22.730
I'm sure the ramen chef would be happy, too.

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:26.710
Thank you, ramen chef.

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:30.990
That's not the right guy, though.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
Target: Sakura

00:24:01.650 --> 00:24:04.600
Hey, Sakura-chan, what 
do you think of my Rinne?

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.750
What? Well, he's a classmate.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:07.420
Anything else?

00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:09.510
I guess he's a poor Shinigami.

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:11.240
You're pretty brutally honest.

00:24:11.240 --> 00:24:13.920
So what do you think of him then, Tamako-san?

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:16.180
What? He's my dear grandson.

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:17.030
Anything else?

00:24:17.030 --> 00:24:19.170
My poor, sad grandson, maybe.

00:24:19.170 --> 00:24:21.730
You're pretty brutally honest, too.

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:25.980
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"Target: Sakura."
